RegisterIdentity=Registering the signed DropSpace Windows Share identity…
DowngradeBlocked=A newer DropSpace version is already installed. Setup blocked this downgrade to protect the installation. Use a newer installer, or explicitly pass /ALLOWDOWNGRADE=1 if you intentionally need to test a downgrade.
InstallCloseBlocked=DropSpace is still running and could not close gracefully. Choose Exit DropSpace, then run Setup again.
UninstallCloseBlocked=DropSpace is still running and could not close gracefully. Choose Exit DropSpace, then start uninstall again.
DeleteData=Also delete local data and settings
DeleteDataFailed=Complete uninstall could not remove the DropSpace local data directory.
DeleteDataHelp=Original files are kept.
